@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #365879
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EEF4F8
title U05 状态图：运行生命周期
state "草稿\nDRAFT" as Draft
state "就绪\nREADY" as Ready
state "运行中\nRUNNING" as Running
state "已暂停\nPAUSED" as Paused
state "已结束\nFINISHED" as Finished
state "失败\nFAILED" as Failed
[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Ready : ValidateConfig [配置有效]
Ready --> Running : StartRun / RunStarted
Running --> Paused : PauseRun / 冻结sim_time
Paused --> Running : ResumeRun / 重新校验暂存提案
Running --> Finished : StopRun / epoch递增
Paused --> Finished : StopRun / epoch递增
Ready --> Failed : 不可恢复错误
Running --> Failed : 不可恢复错误 / epoch递增
Paused --> Failed : 不可恢复错误 / epoch递增
Running --> Paused : 进程重启恢复 / 记录恢复原因
Finished --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
note right of Running
允许注入事件与执行合法提案。
调度器推进仿真时间。
end note
note right of Paused
行动提案DEFER；不推进时间。
控制命令优先，不被暂存提案阻塞。
模型响应可保存，不能改变世界。
end note
note bottom of Finished
结束后仅查询/回放。
终止状态不接受新世界命令。
end note
@enduml
